br>Sorry wasn't getting notifications for this thread for some reason.  <br=
><br>As you can see here, the Bubastis icon in white is this variant.  It h=
as been overperforming considerably despite being a notable nerf from the o=
riginal PG Bubastis.  The Bubastis + Expansion was an overwrought expansion=
 that was mostly devised as a nerf as well that has been scuttled since thi=
s simple 2 Spellbook change was implemented.  The original PG Bubastis vers=
ion was about 2x stronger than either of these variants and would be about =
300% stronger than any other faction in the game.  Power creep is a real pr=
oblem for games like this and Bubastis, Daemon Sultan and even Tcho-Tcho ar=
e a prime example.  <br><br>The number is a weighted average.  If every fac=
tion was perfectly balanced then every faction would have a '1' in this col=
umn.  As you can see factions like Black Goat continue to underperform (eve=
n with ALL of these games being including the OS4 Black Goat buffs) and fac=
tions like Tcho-Tcho and Daemon Sultan and Invasion overperform a lot.  <br=
><br>You'll notice some Glyphs in there for CW Discord exclusive factions. =
 None of which boost or assist any of the leaders in winning.  If anything,=
 all of them have been designed with the present balance skew in mind and w=
ork to avoid punishing the weaker factions.  Every Faction we design has to=
 have a "Black Goat Carveout" allowing for Black Goat's abilities to shine =
brighter in matchups with them and have native anti-Sleeper, Daemon Sultan,=
 Bubasis and Invasion technology baked-in.  <br><br>We'll crunch the number=
s again at the end of 2023.<!----></gg-markup-content><!----></gg-markup><!=
